        "robos:summary": "The Dragonlord is vanquished and the Ball of Light banishes all monsters.",
        "robos:epilogueText": "Holding high the radiant Ball of Light, sunlight pierces the dark clouds over Alefgard for the first time in an age. King Loric steps down from his throne, and Princess Gwaelin takes your hand in marriage as you set sail to found a prosperous new kingdom across the ocean.",
        "robos:choices": []
      },
      {
        "@type": "robos:CRPGStoryNode",
        "id": "node-dw-ending-dark-pact",
