        "robos:summary": "You betray King Loric and rule Alefgard as the Dragonlord's dark champion.",
        "robos:epilogueText": "Seduced by promises of absolute dominion, you take the Dragonlord's outstretched claw. Tantegel Castle falls to your combined legions, and Alefgard is carved into two dark realms ruled by terror and draconic flame.",
        "robos:choices": []
      },
